  "notes": "Legacy Piece is an anime action RPG on Roblox from the Gwynn's Shrine group, inspired by One Piece. You travel between islands, take quests, fight enemies and bosses, and build your character with clans, traits, abilities and gear. The level cap is 12,000, so most of your time goes into farming bosses for better drops and climbing the ranks.\n\nCodes hand out Shards, chests, Drop Potions, Boss Tickets, rerolls and Skill Tree Resets. Drop Potions and Boss Tickets help most early on because they speed up the boss farming the whole game is built around. The developers post new codes with almost every update, bug fix and server shutdown, plus player count goals like 17k CCU, so expect a fresh batch after each patch.",
